    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d464">

                <pb facs="0576" n="468" sameAs="frus:frus1893/pg468"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Gresham to Señor
                            Romero.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1893-11-18"><hi rendition="#italic">November 18,
                        1893</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I have the honor to acknowledge the receipt
                    of your note of the 15th instant, touching a robbery committed at Las Palomas,
                    and the escape of the perpetrators into the United States; and also regarding
                    the alleged organization of a band near Silver City, N. Mex., for similar
                    operations in your country.</p>
                <p>I have addressed the Secretary of War and the governor of New Mexico with a view
                    to preventing the outrages you apprehend.</p>
                <p>Accept, etc,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">W. Q. Gresham</hi>.</signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
